5189_4915271146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6KXSJT5sUpkQ7kNvwG6r-4y&_nc_oc=Adrar_Z1fT1Ex94s1BaaVHuw6qn4Fnh6HfgSxDPFtl0m1US8NMZqSUztqCGY1VncNhU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLaE1XHAT4oyls9naWhPQcsa7sK_VFW8ru92Z8CzwwZ3g&oe=6AAE89B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lXhHahxcZlUQ7kNvwH-GeyZ&_nc_oc=Adqgtf-FK4-80GJmPtqqvJtcCTkddoEdSuu01575xPIhehhVqQP1EH5rqdHH53yogsQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKwCe4RlTftGI9t4redbxkljD2SlkayXN5vtKcu_u7dpw&oe=6AAE9C93"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gQywFOKisgkQ7kNvwHH6I7-&_nc_oc=Ado6-mmDCRAB71_IHkiwDPqs8RJuE3mg6joX2LdZWXYx8ktP9XtrUQSyq2ijP7S6xOs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKsr1mIoj1Sv5An_-qYnGAp-Ay_1ZlaMpglPlSYIjDyVg&oe=6AAE9ADA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_u